{"title":"Open Mic Night + Musician Networking + Fans","startsAt":"2026-10-06T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-06T23:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Let's meet up at Open Mic night at the Function Bar at Yonge and Eglinton. Those who wish to perform can bring your own instrument if you wish. Although the venue has some guitars, drums and a keyboard for the performer on stage.\n\nNon-musicians are also welcome to enjoy some good music, socialize and to meet others. If you are a Musician but don't feel like performing, feel free to just hang out and network with other Musicians for future collabs and jams.\n\n***There is no entry fee but please purchase food and drink to support the venue.***","venue":{"name":"Function Bar","address":"2291 Yonge Street, Toronto","lat":43.70755,"lng":-79.398254,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"OG Music HUB","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/8/4/4/2/highres_518133858.jpeg"}